        "original_id": "a16baf4d-841e-57ed-ba9f-8a96a7109c00",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bobby Moore, Tina Moore, Pelé, Alan Mullery, Les Strong\n- Works: Tina and Bobby\n- Events: 1975 FA Cup Final\n- Organizations: ITV, Fulham, West Ham United, England\n- Topics: football, television\n\nFacts:\n- Bobby Moore is widely regarded as one of the greatest defenders of all time, and Pelé called Bobby Moore the greatest defender he had ever played against.\n- In the 1975 FA Cup Final, Fulham's team included former England captains Bobby Moore and Alan Mullery.\n- In the 1975 FA Cup Final, Bobby Moore made his last appearance at Wembley for Fulham against West Ham United.\n- Les Strong missed the 1975 FA Cup Final against West Ham United because of injury.\n- Tina and Bobby is a British television series about the relationship between footballer Bobby Moore and Tina Moore.\n- Tina and Bobby was first broadcast on ITV on 13 January 2017.",
